logs
tmp
temp
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
bun-debug.log*

# 9. Persistent Storage Volumes & Local Database Dumps
volume
**/volume/*.db*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.dump
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
